# The first learned-RESPONSE arm ([[impossible-step-three-design]]): the
# Impossible base with the razing head on. models/razebrace.ndjson scores
# a sliding photograph of the match's own shape (grouped-CV AUC 0.94-0.95
# at fit); ONCE, when the razing is predicted, the reserve zeroes and
# expansion stands down -- the credits stop being long-run money because
# the long run was just foreclosed. Everything else is flame-nocover.

name imp-brace
